<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Profile</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f2f4f8;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .container {
      width: 80%;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background-color: #fff;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      text-align: center;
    }

    img {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 3px solid #0077b6;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #023e8a;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    p {
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .info {
      margin-top: 20px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .info h3 {
      color: #03045e;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #90e0ef;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .contact {
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .contact a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #0077b6;
      margin: 0 10px;
    }

    .contact a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <img src="profile.jpg" alt="My Profile Photo">
    <h1>Hridya Vinod</h1>
    <p>👩‍💻 B.Tech CSE Student | Passionate about Coding, Problem Solving, and Technology.<br>
       I love learning new programming concepts and building creative projects.</p>

    <div class="info">
      <h3>About Me</h3>
      <p>I'm currently studying Computer Science Engineering and enjoy working on
         programming challenges in C and Python. My interests include web development,
         algorithms, and data structures.</p>

      <h3>Skills</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>C Programming</li>
        <li>HTML & CSS</li>
        <li>Python (Basics)</li>
        <li>Problem Solving</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <div class="contact">
        <a href="mailto:hridya@example.com">📧 Email</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com" target="_blank">🔗 LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank">💻 GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
